  "title": "2015 Ford Mustang: Iconic Performance Value",
  "script": "Imagine iconic performance wrapped in modern design. Meet the 2015 Ford Mustang. A balance of power, price, and personality. Under the hood, choose between a turbocharged 2.3-liter EcoBoost engine or the classic 5.0-liter V8. The EcoBoost offers efficiency with around 310 horsepower, while the V8 roars with 435 horsepower.\n\nBoth come with rear-wheel drive, ensuring that true Mustang feel of power to the pavement. When compared to the Chevy Camaro of the same year, the Mustang often comes out on top in handling and cabin comfort, although both are fierce competitors in the muscle car world.\n\nThe Mustang isn\u2019t just about stock performance. It\u2019s a tuner\u2019s dream. Many owners enjoy upgrading for even more power and unique styling. Enthusiasts know there\u2019s plenty of aftermarket support to make their Mustang truly theirs.\n\nSo, is the 2015 Mustang the right car for you? Would you choose the efficiency of a turbocharged four or the power of a classic V8? Remember, with the Mustang, performance and style come standard. What's your pick?",
